{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act19side_level_act19side_06_end",
  "groupId": "act19side",
  "stageId": "act19side_06",
  "title": "挣脱美梦",
  "storyCode": "DV-6",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act19side/level_act19side_06_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "3ff85f07e40402f50ec97eb10ddb712b7ea0cbf1be975e7053268c549d26f063",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鸮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_128_plosis_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......桑尼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鸮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_128_plosis_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们是自愿的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "摩尔医生，我不明白......您是在代表谁发言？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鸮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_128_plosis_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鸮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_128_plosis_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "信息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鸮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_128_plosis_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我接收到了信息，不同于过去的信息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鸮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_128_plosis_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "乔伊丝，是不是头又疼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鸮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_128_plosis_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我的身体没有问题，赫默医生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鸮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_128_plosis_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一些未经允许的数据涌入了系统中枢。需要额外处理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......数据？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鸮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_128_plosis_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯......桑尼，我们都知道......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鸮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_128_plosis_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这是一场......冒险。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鸮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_128_plosis_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "结果......难以预料，但这是我们的选择。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鸮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_128_plosis_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "数据传输中断，系统判断以上信息的接收者应为桑尼先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "摩尔医生，您说话的语气就好像您是我们......不，躺在那里的受试者之中的一员一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鸮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_128_plosis_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "无法确认上述假设。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鸮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_128_plosis_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "数据来源未知，我只是感受到了它们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这是真的吗，赫默医生？摩尔医生能听到我们的同伴们的声音？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......乔伊丝，你选择了感受这个词语？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鸮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_128_plosis_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是的，赫默医生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鸮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_128_plosis_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "梦境的内容发生了变化。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你看到了什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鸮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_128_plosis_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "无法解析。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你的眼神和平时差别好大......你是感受到悲伤了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鸮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_128_plosis_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "检测到边缘系统信号强烈波动。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鸮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_128_plosis_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......戴拉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "戴拉蕾德？你又想起了她......难道九号装置和弗兰克斯主任的实验也有联系？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鸮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_128_plosis_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "动机，情感，而非逻辑联系。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鸮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_128_plosis_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "赫默医生，我能感受到，这是我们的选择。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你们的......选择？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "桑尼先生，假如我向你保证，我会尽一切努力让所有错误都得到纠正，你是否愿意暂时放过多萝西·弗兰克斯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......赫默医生，我们感激您一路上的帮助，更感激您为我们揭示了实验的真相。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我愿意相信您会站在我们这边——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但您真的能保证这个人不会重启实验吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我不能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可万一她真的这么做了，我会替你解决她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呼......实验暂停，多萝西没有受伤，受试者们也正在逐渐恢复意识......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我还有些不敢相信。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鸮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_128_plosis_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "请不必担心，情绪起伏是正常现象。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "乔伊丝，你醒得太及时了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#12$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我从来没见过奥利维亚那么生气......我真怕她会不管多萝西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#12$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但我还是搞不明白，你为什么能听到受试者们的声音......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#12$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他们的意识是被多萝西的“中枢”连在一起的，可你明明在外面，你到底是怎么被卷进去的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#12$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你不是说，九号装置与“中枢”无关吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鸮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_128_plosis_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有效信息不足，无法做出判断。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鸮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_128_plosis_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是，在梦醒的时候，我听到了迈尔先生的声音。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "梦醒的时候......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那场发生在走廊上的冲突？就连之前的战斗都没能起到作用，为什么那会唤醒你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好奇怪......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不过事情解决了就好，多亏了奥利维亚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鸮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_128_plosis_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "赫默医生做到了，符合预期。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "现在想想......她变化真大啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我刚认识她的时候，她还是个......唔，就大学里很常见的那种好学生，文静腼腆，不太爱说话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鸮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_128_plosis_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "以上描述与我的记忆相符。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "刚刚她逼问多萝西又力保多萝西的时候，我都快认不出她来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就仿佛看到了......另一个人的影子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鸮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_128_plosis_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "乌比卡研究员，你联想的对象是否是塞雷娅主任？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#12$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你、你怎么说出来了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#12$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你可别告诉奥利维亚我说了这样的话啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鸮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_128_plosis_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "赫默医生并不会因此质疑你与她之间的友谊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只是作为她的朋友，我也不想让她在这么麻烦的时刻想起不太愉快的往事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鸮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_128_plosis_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "理解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "走吧，我也该继续完成工作了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "通讯......通讯还没有恢复吗？糟了，老板那边......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#12$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "还有姐姐，真不知道她会给我发多少消息......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "弗兰克斯主任，麻烦你跟我一起离开实验区。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......请等一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "既然实验停了，他们一定不会让这间实验室留下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有一样东西......我必须带走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这是......照片？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "照片上这些都是拓荒者......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这孩子是......你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......赫默医生，我对桑尼说的话，都是真心的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我的母亲，我所有的亲人......曾经都是拓荒者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我从小就听他们诉说自己的梦想，见过他们的奋斗，也目睹过他们的挣扎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是他们的付出令我有机会去追逐我自己的梦想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可是我所拥有的幸运......大多数拓荒者都不可能拥有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你的家人们，他们现在......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......他们之中的大多数都已经离开了我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就在我得到铸铁城理工大学的邀请，回城参加他们为极少数所谓“天才”举办的夏令营的时候......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一场天灾摧毁了我母亲所在的临时基地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "成为一名研究者......曾经也是她的梦想。可她再也没能等到我得到奖学金，被破格录取的好消息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你一定非常难过......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "赫默医生，停下这个实验，真的是正确的选择吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那些拓荒者，那些被生活逼得走投无路的人们，他们或许明天就会遭遇厄运。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而我本可以救他们......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他们不必像我的亲人们一样，绝望地被沙暴吞噬。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕尔维斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_531_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "赫默，为什么要问我这样的问题？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕尔维斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_531_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "没有我们的实验，那个孩子在离开海顿一号实验室之后根本活不了几天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕尔维斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_531_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们救活了她，我甚至让你照顾她的起居，她不仅能享受衣食无忧的生活，还能为推动科学进步做贡献——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕尔维斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_531_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "相比在荒野上因为矿石病而悄无声息死去的孩子们，她是多么幸运啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕尔维斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_531_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我那么信任你、器重你，你竟然......在这么细枝末节的操作问题上指责我、指责科学本身？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我不知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这个答案也不应该由我告诉你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "乔伊丝提醒了我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "即便我永远不会赞同你们......你的行为，我也不该用我的标准来评判一切。"
