      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_522_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......不用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_522_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们继续。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "其他人都撤出去了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是的，领队。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱茵防卫科成员",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_528_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "下一个。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他们在做什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "说是什么预防程序，大概是想给我们打什么镇定剂吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们也算是闹了很大一通，是吧，头儿？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......别忘了我说过的，等他们问起来，事情都是我做的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "放心吧，不会让你一个人担着的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你这家伙......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱茵防卫科成员",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_528_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "下一个。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我叫桑尼·罗马诺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱茵防卫科成员",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_528_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我没问你姓名。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "麻烦你跟你们头领说一声，绑架的事情都是我的个人行为。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱茵防卫科成员",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_528_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱茵防卫科成员",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_528_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "右手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "打完针以后，你们总该处理这件事了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎么回事......乌比卡博士？你为什么要撞我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不要接受注射！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱茵防卫科成员",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_528_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "研究员，你妨碍了我们的工作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "正好，你的注射器里装着的，是我的工作成果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "需不需要我给你解释下这东西的适用对象？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊？他们不是你和赫默医生的同事吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你......怎么该相信的时候胡乱怀疑，该怀疑的时候这么容易相信别人啊？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "把你手上的环也拿下来，快——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......紧急医疗环？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我看到他们给你注射才想起来，乔伊丝为什么会醒！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "医疗环，就是这东西！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "发给你们的医疗环都被改造过，上面有和多萝西实验室里的仪器类似的感受器，只要和递质一接触就会......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我得汇报给主任，从始至终都有人在背后利用......利用......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "该死，通讯......通讯又断了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "原来......原来是这样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我一直都......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "乌比卡博士，你看起来怎么像要哭了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......哭？不，我只是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这不重要。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "危机根本没有解除，桑尼，你们的敌人从来都不是多萝西！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
